{
  "_about": "More traffic sounds (2026-11-04): extra loops for the freeway mix, in the same shape as traffic_sounds.json (one steady mono loop per vehicle at road speed, panned and pitched by the game). Second and third takes of the commonest classes, so two cars in a row rarely sound alike, and loops for the classes added to the freeway: SUV, minivan, sports car, RV, tanker and car hauler. Render with genny 0.2.0 (github.com/ogomez92/genny, f23f439): genny render sound-test/traffic_variety.json, then the same ffmpeg EQ as the first set (equalizer=f=1200:t=o:w=2:g=12,equalizer=f=300:t=o:w=1.5:g=-3), each level-matched to the shipped loop it sits beside (cars to car_loop, trucks to semi_loop and so on), and encoded to Ogg Vorbis at -q:a 5. The RV and car hauler carry a faint square-gated rattle for the body and the deck chains.",
